{
 "_doc": "Thor, god (GAME_DESIGN.md: Gods; art 10/31/2026). Built by tools/art/build_god_thor.py; rules in docs/ART_RULES.md. From Snorri Sturluson's Prose Edda (Gylfaginning 21: his three treasures, the hammer Mjollnir, the belt of strength Megingjord, and the iron gloves he needs to grip the hammer; Skaldskaparmal 35: the hammer's handle is rather short) and the sagas' red-bearded Thor. The hammer's shape follows Viking Age Thor's-hammer pendants. Viking Age dress: a tunic, trousers with leg wraps, leather shoes. The gold crown is the owner's choice (10/31/2026), not from the sources. Not based on any modern version (GAME_DESIGN.md: never Marvel's Thor: no winged helmet, no red cape).",
